our favorite snacks.

00:05:00.666 --> 00:05:02.935
Can you explain --
Do you like hot foods?

00:05:02.935 --> 00:05:04.170
-It's a tragedy, man.

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:05.738
[ Laughter ]

00:05:05.738 --> 00:05:10.176
You ever just tried to go buy
a bag of just regular chips?

00:05:10.176 --> 00:05:12.010
