00:05:23.155 --> 00:05:25.090
Like, it's just --
I want a --

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:27.994
Everything ain't
got to be flamin'.

00:05:27.994 --> 00:05:29.662
It's okay to just have
some regular [bleep]

00:05:29.662 --> 00:05:31.697
I just want regular [bleep]

00:05:31.697 --> 00:05:33.599
There's flamin' hot cereals now.

00:05:33.599 --> 00:05:35.234
[ Laughter ]
-What --

00:05:35.234 --> 00:05:36.803
-Flamin' Cinnamon Toast Crunch.

00:05:36.803 --> 00:05:38.671
-There's flamin' hot --
-Flamin', bitch.

00:05:38.671 --> 00:05:42.307
Flamin' hot
Cinnamon Toast Crunch.

00:05:42.307 --> 00:05:44.977
Do you -- Do we really need
spicy milk?

00:05:44.977 --> 00:05:47.012
-No.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:47.012 --> 00:05:48.814
-Do you need your milk
to be spicy?

00:05:48.814 --> 00:05:49.715
-No.

00:05:49.715 --> 00:05:51.351
-We already know
what regular milk

00:05:51.351 --> 00:05:53.585
